      "title": "PNCINFRA: New Highway Wins Will Support Future Upside Potential",
      "body": "Analysts have adjusted their price target on PNC Infratech from ₹322.80 to ₹305.27, reflecting updated assumptions on fair value, discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E. What's in the News PNC Infratech emerged as the first lowest bidder for two National Highways Authority of India HAM projects in Uttar Pradesh, with a combined bid project cost of ₹34,830 million, exclusive of GST, and a construction period of 24 months for each project (Key Developments).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
