      "date": "2026-04-12T16:05:36.000Z",
      "title": "PNCINFRA: Upcoming Results Review Will Support Future Upside Potential",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target for PNC Infratech by about ₹4 to ₹322.8, as they adjust assumptions around revenue growth, profitability, discount rate and future P/E to reflect a more balanced view of risks and returns. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled for February 9, 2026, at 12:30 Indian Standard Time to review unaudited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and nine months ended December 31, 2025 (company filing).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
